        <activityName xml:lang="en">Fibre cement facing tile, small format, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Fibre cement facing tile, small format, at plant
Data are based on a in depth analysis of the production of Eternit Switzerland. Different products (base colours &amp; coatings) are averaged.;
UUID: ceef0673-57e6-3161-bf8a-c2015bd75e44
All processes relating to the product at the Eternit production plant in Niederurnen and in Payern are included. Also included are the material and energy input and the waste treatment services corresponding to these processes.
Location: Production in Switzerland for World wide market
Technology: Raw tile production, drying, coating
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Measurement in plant (1 year) 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ceef0673-57e6-3161-bf8a-c2015bd75e44.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
